\ combinators.mf — small higher-order helpers in practice
\
\ Run snippets interactively in the REPL, or `require` this file and call words.

: demo-dip      ( -- )  4 [ 1 2 + ] dip ;
: demo-keep     ( -- )  3 4 [ + ] keep ;
: demo-2dip     ( -- )  10 100 200 [ 1 + ] 2dip ;
: demo-2keep    ( -- )  100 200 [ + ] 2keep ;
: demo-bi       ( -- )  5 [ 1 + ] [ 2 * ] bi ;
: demo-tri      ( -- )  5 [ 1 + ] [ 2 * ] [ dup * ] tri ;

\ A tiny editor-ish pattern: compute two derived values from the same buffer text.
: dup+len       ( s -- s n )  [ ] [ len ] bi ;
